  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Growth in IDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An informal working group, established during IDA16 negotiations, has looked at the emerging inclusive growth agenda and the possible opportunities for IDA to support more broadly anchored patterns of growth in IDA countries by adopting an inclusive growth appraoch in its country Work. The working group needed to look into whether the growth diagnostic appraoch is already influencing IDA&apos;s analytical work in-country and the possible further scope for orienting IDA country analytical work.

The report is a review of the extent to which the inclusive growth diagnostic approach has influenced IDA in its analytical work, and how this has translated into the strategic definition of its operations in selected countries to provide recommendations for strengthening inclusive growth in diagnostics and and policy work.</narrative>
  </description>
